the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones house  of the dragon update video all right my  friends in this video i will be  discussing the upcoming release of hbo's  new game of thrones series house of the  dragon as you all know hbo has been  developing this new game of thrones  series for a number of years like game  of thrones house of the dragon will be  set within george rr martin's a song of  ice and fire universe this show will  focus on what happened during the dance  of dragons when house targaryen went to  war with each other over the iron throne  and the line of succession  the events surrounding the dance of  dragons happened over a hundred years  before the main events in game of  thrones you can read about them in  george rr martin's novel fire and blood  vol 1. now some of you might not know  this but house of the dragon was  recently rated as the most highly  anticipated show of the year even with  the divisive ending in game of thrones  there are millions of fans still dying  to see what hbo does with their  follow-up show set in westeros one of  the main things fans are wanting to know  is when will we actually see house of  the dragon now we have all heard it will  release this year but how much longer do  we have to wait well from most of the  accounts i have seen it does look like  hbo is done filming the first season of  house of the dragon now they might still  have to do some reshoots here and there  but it does sound like most of the cast  and crew are done we have seen various  members of the cast announce that they  are done filming but the cast members  are rarely on set for the whole shoot  anyway the real sign the filming is  wrapping up is when the crew starts to  say their goodbyes on social media and  the house of the dragons account 